desc: Align the equals signs
category: manual
par: 20
hint1: Think column-wise or dot command
hint2: f finds =, insert a space before it, then . repeats — skip already-aligned lines
solution: f=i <Esc>...+f=..++f=...
note: f= jumps to the =, i <Esc> inserts a space before it; . repeats that edit,
note: padding each line until the = signs line up (skip already-aligned lines).
--- START ---
x = 1
foo = 2
hello = 3
ab = 4
world = 5
--- GOAL ---
x     = 1
foo   = 2
hello = 3
ab    = 4
world = 5
--- END ---
